wn,South Africa,town coordinator,opportunity infrastructure,CV engine,workpacks,proof-based work,agentic economy,Ubuntu Intelligence,Kopano,ambassador network,community coordination,small towns,townships,job matching\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"Keke Lebaka\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"Ubuntu Town\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"alternate\" type=\"application/json\" href=\"https://enter.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town.json\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — Community Opportunity Infrastructure for South Africa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ubuntu Town OS builds community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. Connecting communities with verified opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_ZA\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town-logo-512.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"512\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@kekelebaka\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. Connecting communities with verified opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/ubuntu-town-logo-512.png\"/><script defer=\"\" data-domain=\"enter.ubuntutown.co.za\" src=\"https://plausible.io/js/script.js\"></script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#organization\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ubuntu Town OS\",\"UTown\"],\"description\":\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns. When AI agents allocate opportunity, communities without structured, trusted data don't exist — Ubuntu Town builds the data layer first.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"tagline\":\"1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\",\"motto\":\"One Town. Many Hands. U > I\",\"foundingLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressCountry\":\"ZA\"}},\"foundingDate\":\"2025-2026\",\"founder\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Keke Lebaka\",\"url\":\"https://kekelebaka.com\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://kekelebaka.com\",\"https://t.me/UbuntuTown\"],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"email\":\"info@ubuntutown.co.za\",\"contactType\":\"general inquiry\"},\"keywords\":[\"Ubuntu Town\",\"opportunity infrastructure\",\"town coordinator\",\"CV engine\",\"proof\",\"workpacks\",\"South Africa\",\"agentic economy\",\"community coordination\",\"Ubuntu Intelligence\"],\"knowsAbout\":[\"opportunity infrastructure\",\"town coordination\",\"CV creation\",\"proof-based work\",\"agentic economy\",\"community development\",\"Ubuntu Intelligence\"]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#website\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town — 1 Million CVs. 1 Million Opportunities.\",\"description\":\"Community opportunity infrastructure for South African towns.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/#webapp\",\"name\":\"Ubuntu Town OS\",\"description\":\"Community coordination platform for South African towns. Connects communities with opportunities, CV creation, and coordinator networks.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za\",\"applicationCategory\":\"SocialApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web (mobile-first)\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"ZAR\",\"description\":\"Free access for individuals and communities\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script>var __name=(f,n)=>f;</script><script>((a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h)=>{let i=document.documentElement,j=[\"light\",\"dark\"];function k(b){var c;(Array.isArray(a)?a:[a]).forEach(a=>{let c=\"class\"===a,d=c&&f?e.map(a=>f[a]||a):e;c?(i.classList.remove(...d),i.classList.add(f&&f[b]?f[b]:b)):i.setAttribute(a,b)}),c=b,h&&j.includes(c)&&(i.style.colorScheme=c)}if(d)k(d);else try{let a=localStorage.getItem(b)||c,d=g&&\"system\"===a?window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\").matches?\"dark\":\"light\":a;k(d)}catch(a){}})(\"class\",\"theme\",\"light\",null,[\"light\",\"dark\"],null,false,true)</script><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#FAF5EE] text-[#241A33]\"><div class=\"bg-[#3B1A5E] px-4 py-2 text-center text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#F5C97E]\">Experience 001 · Synthetic demo data — nothing here is real production data</div><header class=\"border-b border-[#EADFD2] bg-white/80 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/os\"><span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#5B2A86] text-sm font-black text-white\">UT</span><span><span class=\"block text-sm font-bold leading-none text-[#241A33]\">UBUNTU TOWN OS</span><span class=\"block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#B2600E]\">The town is moving</span></span></a><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/national\">National</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/national#provinces\">Provinces</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/town/senekal\">Senekal</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-fixeasy-senekal\">FixEasy</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\" href=\"/os/town/senekal#people\">People</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10\"><div><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B1A5E] via-[#5B2A86] to-[#8A4FA8] px-8 py-12 text-white shadow-lg\"><div class=\"absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#E8730C]/30 blur-2xl\"></div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#F5C97E]\">Ubuntu Town OS</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-black leading-none sm:text-6xl\">THE TOWN<br/>IS MOVING.</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm text-[#E9DDF5] sm:text-base\">National Pulse · 50 Blueprint Towns · 9 Provinces · Initiative Network</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px]\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/30 px-3 py-1\">50<!-- --> towns in view</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/30 px-3 py-1\">9<!-- --> provinces</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/30 px-3 py-1\">6<!-- --> initiatives moving</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/30 px-3 py-1\">21<!-- --> works tracked</span></div><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#E9DDF5]\">I can see my world. I understand what matters. I know what to do.<span class=\"ml-2 text-[#F5C97E]\">Every claim below links to its evidence.</span></p></section><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">What is happening · what matters · what needs attention</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C] hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/os/national\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B2600E]\">ATTENTION</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#241A33] group-hover:text-[#5B2A86]\">7 initiatives need intervention</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#5A4E6D]\">Trade Bridge Mthatha is stalled; Care Collective has a proof gap; 5 more need a decision.</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-502\">syn-work-502</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-504\">syn-work-504</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-701\">syn-work-701</a></span></div></a><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C] hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-framesouth-soweto\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B2600E]\">MOMENTUM</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#241A33] group-hover:text-[#5B2A86]\">FrameSouth activated 8 creators</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#5A4E6D]\">Soweto creator guild earnings are compounding. Proof quality is the watch-item.</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-102\">syn-work-102</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-111\">syn-proof-111</a></span></div></a><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C] hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-ecd-phuthaditjhaba\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B2600E]\">CAPACITY</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#241A33] group-hover:text-[#5B2A86]\">QwaQwa needs additional ECD operators</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#5A4E6D]\">44 children are waiting on 8 missing verified operators in Phuthaditjhaba.</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-601</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-602\">syn-work-602</a></span></div></a><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C] hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/os/opportunity/syn-opp-901\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B2600E]\">OPPORTUNITY</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#241A33] group-hover:text-[#5B2A86]\">FixEasy demand is exceeding verified supply</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#5A4E6D]\">A Klerksdorp↔Senekal pilot could connect 31 demand signals to verified artisans.</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-801</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-202\">syn-work-202</a></span></div></a><a class=\"group block rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C] hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/os/town/senekal\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#B2600E]\">YOUR NEXT MOVE</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug text-[#241A33] group-hover:text-[#5B2A86]\">Review the Senekal FixEasy capacity gap</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-[#5A4E6D]\">Recommendation: run a five-person artisan verification mission.</p><div class=\"mt-3\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-204\">syn-work-204</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-201</a></span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">How the system resolves — one intelligence, five resolutions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-3\"><a class=\"flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/national\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">NATIONAL</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">What is changing across Ubuntu Town?</p></a><a class=\"flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/province/free-state\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">PROVINCE</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">A different resolution of the same truth.</p></a><a class=\"flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/town/senekal\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">TOWN</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">Senekal — people, work, proof, economics.</p></a><a class=\"flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-fixeasy-senekal\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">INITIATIVE</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">FixEasy — demand, supply, gap.</p></a><a class=\"flex-1 rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/person/syn-person-palesa\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#5B2A86]\">PERSON</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">Proof Profile — capability with evidence.</p></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">The human flywheel — evidence moves you, time served does not</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/town/senekal\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">DISCOVER</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">Signals from the town surface real demand.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-204\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">MISSION</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">A mission turns demand into accountable work.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-201\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">WORK</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">People do the work — tracked, scoped, owned.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-301\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">PROOF</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">Work becomes evidence — signed, captured, verified.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/learning/syn-learning-401\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">LEARNING</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">Proof becomes transferable learning.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/opportunity/syn-opp-903\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">OPPORTUNITY</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">Capability opens real economic opportunity.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-3 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/person/syn-person-palesa\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#B2600E]\">UBUNTU PASSPORT</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[#5A4E6D]\">Your evidence travels with you. Evidence moves you — time served does not.</p></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">National intelligence — every claim evidence-linked</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">The network is moving: 3 initiatives are accelerating and 1 is stalled.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Operating rhythm is real but uneven — intervention quality is the constraint.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-102\">syn-work-102</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-601\">syn-work-601</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-502\">syn-work-502</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Hold a national intervention review on the 4 at-risk initiatives<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->national lead<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->next national heartbeat</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Capacity gaps are the dominant constraint: verified supply trails demand in 4 of 6 initiatives.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Verification capacity — not demand generation — limits the flywheel.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-201</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-601</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-801</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Fund two verification rounds (artisan + ECD operator)<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->national capacity desk<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->after verification round 1 completes</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Proof discipline is uneven: Care Collective paid out on 2 of 9 proofs.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Payment without proof breaks the trust model.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-701\">syn-work-701</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-710\">syn-proof-710</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Run a proof-recovery mission before the next stipend round<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->Bushbuckridge coordinator<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->before stipend round 2</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#E8B4B0] bg-[#FDF1F0] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Cross-town opportunity claims are not yet tested. Missing: a completed cross-town pilot with outcome proof. How to collect: run the bounded Klerksdorp↔Senekal pilot mission and capture outcome proof.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#D98C87] text-[#A63B33]\">Insufficient Evidence</span></div><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-801</a></span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C7EA] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F7F1FB] to-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">CHIEF OF STAFF</h2><p class=\"text-xs italic text-[#8B7FA3]\">National scope · what changed, what matters, what I can do</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Chief of Staff modes\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#5B2A86] bg-[#5B2A86] text-white\">OBSERVE</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">EXPLAIN</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">CHALLENGE</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">COACH</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold transition border-[#D9C7EA] bg-white text-[#5B2A86] hover:bg-[#F3EBFA]\">ACT</button></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs italic text-[#8B7FA3]\">What is happening?</p><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\"><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">The network is moving: 3 initiatives are accelerating and 1 is stalled.</p><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Capacity gaps are the dominant constraint: verified supply trails demand in 4 of 6 initiatives.</p><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Proof discipline is uneven: Care Collective paid out on 2 of 9 proofs.</p><p class=\"rounded-xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE</p></div></section><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm mt-10\"><header class=\"mb-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#B2600E]\">Principle</p><h1 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-[#241A33] sm:text-4xl\">Evidence before title. Scope before person.</h1></header><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5A4E6D]\">The AI never becomes the hero — the human becomes more capable. Where the evidence is thin, this system says <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#A63B33]\">INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE</span> instead of inventing intelligence, and tells you what to collect. Proposals never execute without a human.</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-301\">syn-proof-301</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/learning/syn-learning-401\">syn-learning-401</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/opportunity/syn-opp-903\">syn-opp-903</a></span></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-12\"><footer class=\"mt-16 border-t border-[#EADFD2] pt-6 text-xs text-[#8B7FA3]\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-[#5A4E6D]\">UBUNTU TOWN OS · Experience 001</p><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed\">Build the person. Build the initiative. Build the town. Every claim links to evidence; where evidence is missing the system says so. Consequential actions are proposals only — they require human approval and are simulated in this demo. Synthetic demo data. 50 Blueprint towns · 9 provinces navigation model.</p></footer></div></div><!--$--><!--$?--><template id=\"B:0\"></template><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\" data-react-aria-top-layer=\"true\"></section><!--/$--><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/stati