esk, review: after verification round 1 completes)\",\"Coach: Run a proof-recovery mission before the next stipend round (owner: Bushbuckridge coordinator, review: before stipend round 2)\"],\"ACT\":[\"PROPOSE ONLY — Hold a national intervention review on the 4 at-risk initiatives → requires human approval\",\"PROPOSE ONLY — Fund two verification rounds (artisan + ECD operator) → requires human approval\",\"PROPOSE ONLY — Run a proof-recovery mission before the next stipend round → requires human approval\"]},\"actRows\":[{\"action\":\"Hold a national intervention review on the 4 at-risk initiatives\",\"owner\":\"national lead\",\"rationale\":\"Operating rhythm is real but uneven — intervention quality is the constraint.\",\"evidence\":[\"syn-work-102\",\"syn-work-601\",\"syn-work-502\"],\"reviewPoint\":\"next national heartbeat\",\"approvalStatus\":\"PROPOSED — PENDING HUMAN APPROVAL\"},{\"action\":\"Fund two verification rounds (artisan + ECD operator)\",\"owner\":\"national capacity desk\",\"rationale\":\"Verification capacity — not demand generation — limits the flywheel.\",\"evidence\":[\"syn-signal-201\",\"syn-signal-601\",\"syn-signal-801\"],\"reviewPoint\":\"after verification round 1 completes\",\"approvalStatus\":\"PROPOSED — PENDING HUMAN APPROVAL\"},{\"action\":\"Run a proof-recovery mission before the next stipend round\",\"owner\":\"Bushbuckridge coordinator\",\"rationale\":\"Payment without proof breaks the trust model.\",\"evidence\":[\"syn-work-701\",\"syn-proof-710\"],\"reviewPoint\":\"before stipend round 2\",\"approvalStatus\":\"PROPOSED — PENDING HUMAN APPROVAL\"}]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-5 shadow-sm mt-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#B2600E]\",\"children\":\"Principle\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-3xl font-bold leading-tigh